Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our design puts Jev at the memory boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A local listener intercepts the trajectory and checks what may reach the classifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Company policy and employee Markdown files supply the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jev returns structured decisions with confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hook removes excluded spans and prepares clean facts and trajectories for GBrain,\Nwith a separate training permission gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This prototype simulates Jev with local rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the demo.
